  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "whbHivScreech001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "尖锐嘶鸣",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>蜂巢怪持续发出高频嘶鸣。约 <strong>120 尺</strong>内可被听见（听觉）；其他猎人/怪物可能因此定位战场。察觉它时，可凭声响获得方向提示（GM 裁定）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": {
          "value": [
            "auditory"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHivSideHead01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "侧垂头颅",
      "sort": 510000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>头从颈侧耷拉下来。若攻击者位于它的<strong>正后方</strong>（背对），瞄准头部/要害的打击视为对隐蔽目标：须先通过 @Check[flat|dc:5]{DC 5 持平检定}，否则未击中；且该类打击不造成精密伤害（「爆头」很难）。从正面或侧面攻击不受此限。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": {
          "value": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHivNoMelee001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "不直接攻击",
      "sort": 520000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>蜂巢怪本身几乎不做近战打击。威胁来自毒蜂群与嘶鸣暴露。移动极其缓慢（速度 10 尺）。因擅长远程骚扰，是少数可出现在<strong>屋顶</strong>的怪物，也可出现在别处。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": {
          "value": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHivRelease001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "放出毒蜂",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 2
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>自敞开的胸腔蜂巢放出一群毒蜂。在邻接空格生成 1 个 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-actors.Actor.whbHuntBeeSwm001]{腐沼毒蜂群}。场上由同一蜂巢怪放出的毒蜂群最多 <strong>1</strong> 个；若已有存活蜂群，此动作无效。</p>\n<p>毒蜂群会追击猎人；飞离母体超过 60 尺则消散。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": {
          "value": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHivReplen0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp",
      "name": "再放一群",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "reaction"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你放出的毒蜂群被消灭或因离母体过远而消散，且你仍存活</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你可立刻使用「放出毒蜂」的效果（不花费动作），在邻接空格生成新的毒蜂群。若本回合已用过反应，则改为在你下一回合开始时免费放出。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
